            <ArticleTitle>[Healthy diet].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>189-93</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A proper diet is important with regard to oral health and even more so with regard to general health aspects, such as coronary heart disease and various types of cancer. Present guidelines on diet in the Netherlands emphasize the importance of variety in diet, limited use of (saturated) fats, ample use of complex carbohydrates and limited use of cholesterol as well as alcohol.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
